# 7 Huenicorns

<img src="./images/cover.png" alt="Prism Paddock" width="320" />

**A tiny card duel about unicorns and rainbows.**

Your goal: **complete your rainbow before your opponent does.**

In **7 Huenicorns**, every card is a colorful unicorn waiting to become part of your rainbow. Build the right combinations, turn your unicorns into rainbow fragments, and race to collect all seven colors.

But getting the cards you need isn't always that simple. You'll have to make choices, read your opponent, and sometimes decide what you're willing to leave behind for them.

## How to Play

Build the rainbow before your opponent!

1. **Split**  
   The _Dealer_ splits 4 unicorns into 2 pairs.
2. **Pick**  
   The _Receiver_ picks a pair; the Dealer keeps the other.  
    _(your stable only fits **5 unicorns**, so choose carefully what you keep!)_
3. **Make 7**  
   Match two unicorns whose values add up to 7 (1+6, 2+5, 3+4).
4. **Make a Fragment**  
   From your matched pair, keep one unicorn as a Rainbow Fragment of its color; the other unicorn is discarded. If you already own a Fragment of that color, you draw a new unicorn instead of a duplicate.
5. **Complete the Rainbow**  
   Collect a Fragment of each of the 7 colors to win!
